s earnings Tuesday.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n1"},{"cat":"World","title":"U.S. envoys meet Putin, then Zelenskyy in Dublin on bringing Europe into talks","summary":"Witkoff and Kushner met Putin in Moscow and then briefed Zelenskyy near Dublin; Kushner said Putin is willing to try including Europe, though the Kremlin played it down. EU leaders have not chosen an envoy and may decide at a Nov. 26-27 summit.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/eu-leaders-gather-in-dublin-to-decide-who-will-speak-for-europe-in-peace-talks","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n2"},{"cat":"World","title":"Iran's IRGC says it destroyed a U.S. radar in Bahrain","summary":"Iranian state media said the Revolutionary Guards struck a U.S. early-warning radar in Bahrain, home to the Fifth Fleet, in response to an attack on a telecom tower in southern Iran. The claim was not independently confirmed; Qatar and Pakistan continue mediating.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/irgc-says-it-destroyed-us-radar-in-bahrain-after-attack-on-southern-iran","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n3"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Brooklyn building collapse death toll rises to at least eight","summary":"A three-storey residential building collapsed next to an excavation site in Brooklyn on Wednesday, killing at least eight and sending 17 to hospital, four critically. About 250 responders searched the rubble by hand; the cause is under investigation.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/at-least-two-dead-while-others-are-trapped-in-the-rubble-after-a-building-collapse-in-new-","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n4"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Microsoft outage hits Outlook, Teams and Copilot in 74 countries","summary":"A Microsoft 365 outage that began Thursday spread to SharePoint, Defender and other services, with nearly 140,000 Outlook reports on Downdetector. It was not fully fixed Friday morning; Microsoft says there is no sign of a cyberattack.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/microsoft-outage-explained-what-went-wrong-and-is-your-data-at-risk","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n5"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Joly gives Stellantis 30 days to repay Ottawa or face a lawsuit","summary":"Industry Minister Melanie Joly says Stellantis owes hundreds of millions of dollars after selling its idle Brampton plant to defence maker Roshel. Ottawa committed up to $529M in 2022; over 2,000 laid-off Brampton workers are affected.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12147000/ford-feds-unifor-set-for-high-stakes-meeting-with-stellantis/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Stocks close lower on Nvidia rout; 10-year yield tops 5.1%","summary":"The S&P 500 fell 0.35%, the Dow 0.36% to 52,297 and the Nasdaq 100 0.30% Thursday as Nvidia slid over 4%. The 10-year Treasury yield jumped 11.9 basis points to 5.111% and WTI crude rose more than 2%.","source":"Barchart via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/stocks-settle-lower-nvidia-rout-214216864.html","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n7"},{"cat":"World","title":"Israeli strike on Gaza's Nasser hospital kills six, WHO says","summary":"An Israeli strike hit Nasser Medical Complex in Khan Younis early Thursday, killing six people including a surgeon and injuring at least 27, per the WHO. Israel said it targeted a senior Hamas commander but gave no evidence.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/12/gaza-devastation-inside-nasser-hospital-after-deadly-israeli-strike","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n8"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Congress summons Jensen Huang and Howard Lutnick to testify","summary":"The Senate Banking Committee asked ex-Nvidia CEO Huang and Commerce Secretary Lutnick to testify and is ready to subpoena Huang. Three House committees requested a closed-door interview with Huang on Dec. 1.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/ex-nvidia-ceo-huang-and-us-commerce-secretary-howard-lutnick-summoned-to-testify-before-co","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n9"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Carney joins European leaders in Dublin before heading to Asia","summary":"PM Mark Carney attended the European Political Community summit in Dublin, where Zelenskyy briefed leaders on talks with Russia, and met the leaders of Greece and Cyprus. He left Thursday evening for summits in Asia.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12147657/carney-ireland-visit/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Van Hollen to challenge Schumer for Senate Democratic leader","summary":"Sen. Chris Van Hollen of Maryland, 67, says he will run against Chuck Schumer, 75, to lead Senate Democrats in the next Congress, with backing from some progressives. Schumer says he has the votes to keep the post.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/us-senator-chris-van-hollen-to-challenge-chuck-schumer-for-senate-majority-leader","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n11"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Google upgrades Search AI Mode with new Gemini 4 Hydrogen model","summary":"Google is rolling out Gemini 4 Hydrogen to all Search users globally, saying it handles complex, multi-part questions better and runs 2.5x faster than Gemini 3.8 Flash. It is also coming to AI Studio, the Gemini API and the Gemini app.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/googles-latest-search-upgrade-promises-better-answers-to-your-most-complicated-questions/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n12"},{"cat":"Business","title":"European and Asian shares slip as Nvidia CEO exit stirs AI doubts","summary":"Paris and Frankfurt opened down 0.3% and the FTSE 100 0.2% Friday; the Hang Seng fell over 1.5% and SoftBank 5.1%, while Taiwan's Taiex rose 1.35%. Brent crude traded near $96.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/european-shares-fall-as-nvidia-ceos-exit-raises-doubts-over-ai-boom","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n13"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Nebius plans $40B in 2027 spending; shares drop 17%","summary":"AI cloud provider Nebius reported Q3 revenue of $981M, up 571%, but cut its 2026 forecast by $200M to $3B on data-centre delays. It guided 2027 revenue of $12-13B with about $40B in capex.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/nebius-tests-the-neocloud-playbook-with-40-billion-in-planned-spending/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canadian trips to the U.S. rise 3% in October","summary":"Statistics Canada counted 1.9 million Canadian return trips from the U.S. by car and air in October, a seventh straight yearly gain, though still well below 2024 levels. American visits to Canada rose 8.1% to 1.5 million.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12148020/canada-us-travel-october-2026/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n15"},{"cat":"World","title":"Pope Leo XIV greeted by about 3 million in Lima on Peru visit","summary":"Pope Leo XIV, who spent over two decades in Peru as a missionary and bishop, began a six-day visit, the last leg of a Latin American tour. Vatican estimates put the Lima crowd at about 3 million.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/pope-leo-xiv-welcomed-by-millions-on-return-to-his-second-home-peru","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n16"},{"cat":"AI","title":"United Airlines blocks AI agents from booking flights","summary":"United will restrict AI agents and autonomous assistants from booking and managing reservations, citing cybersecurity risks and federal aviation rules. It warned that sharing credentials with AI assistants can expose personal data.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/united-airlines-blocks-ai-agents-from-booking-flights-citing-cybersecurity-risks/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n17"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"RBC says AI spending isn't lifting Canada's GDP like in the U.S.","summary":"RBC economists expect AI investment to be net-neutral for Canadian GDP because most equipment is imported; imports of computer equipment are up 75% from a year earlier.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12146941/canada-ai-gdp-growth/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n18"}]}